      "content": "# ✨Adventurers! Exclusive Events Coming Soon to the Official Top-up Platform\n\nTop up through the Official Top-Up Platform and unlock chances to win Vouchers and other in-game rewards! 🎁\n✦ Event 1: Cumulative Top-up Lottery✦ \n⏰ [Event Schedule] \nSep 7, 2026, 00:00:00 – Oct 4, 2026, 23:59:59 \n\n📝 [Event Details] \n-You will earn 1 draw attempt for every 9,999 Vouchers topped up through the official top-up platform (excluding bonus Vouchers from rebates). There is no limit to the number of draw attempts you can earn.\n-Top-ups are tracked per character. Top-ups made on different characters cannot be combined to earn draw attempts.\n-Top-up Tracking Period: Sep 7, 2026, 00:00:00 – Oct 4, 2026, 23:59:59 (UTC-5)\n🎁Prize Pool: You have a chance to win prizes such as Voucher ×29,999, Voucher ×9,999, Voucher ×4,999, Voucher ×999 and so on.\n\n💡[Reward Distribution] \n-In-game items will be sent to the mailbox of the character selected on the event page.\n-Limited-quantity rewards are available while supplies last.\n\n✦－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－✦\n\n✦ Event 2: Daily Top-up Sign-in✦ \n⏰ [Event Schedule] \nSep 7, 2026, 00:00:00 – Sep 6, 2027, 23:59:59 (UTC-5)\n\n📝 [Event Details] \n-You will earn 1 draw attempt each day by topping up any amount through the official top-up platform during the event.\n-Eligibility to earn draw attempts resets daily at 00:00 (UTC-5). You can earn up to 1 draw attempt per day. Any unused draw attempt from the previous day will be cleared, so be sure to use it before the daily reset.\n\n🎁Prize Pool: You have a chance to win prizes such as Voucher ×9,999,Voucher ×999, Bond Trinket ×1, Covenite ×1 and so on.\n\n 💡[Reward Distribution] \n-In-game items will be sent to the mailbox of the character selected on the event page.\n-If you have any questions, feel free to contact Customer Support.\n\n🔗 After offical launch, tap the link below to visit the Official Top-Up Platform and join the event! https://gamepay.boltray.com/addCredit?cur_game=8039&media=A803903",
