      "content": "# Dungeon Preview | Venture into the Crystal Spiral Tree!\n \nHey, Adventurers! Naira here!\nReach the top of Acme Nexus, and Aethyris awaits!\nWith Reina leading the way, we've arrived at our very first dungeon—the Crystal Spiral Tree!\n \nThis colossal ancient tree towers over Aethyris,\nits roots reaching deep into the crystal veins beneath the kingdom.\nNow, a lightning-wielding Chaosborn has made the tree its lair,\nspreading corruption through its roots and into the earth below.\n \nHere's the intel on the Crystal Spiral Tree!\nHead inside and drive out the Chaos monsters lurking within!\n \nAh... wait! Adventurer!\nLooks like you've picked up some Chaos corruption too!\nQuick, go find Saintess Astrid—\nshe'll know what to do...!",
