      "timestamp": "2026-09-24T01:54:23.619000+00:00",
      "edited_timestamp": null,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "# EventOverview | Thunderous Crusade Is Now Live!\nHey, Adventurers! Naira here!\n \nThunder splits the sky as a divine figure steps through an otherworldly rift.\nHe commands the heavens and wields the thunder itself.\nLord of Olympus. King of the Gods. Zeus.\nBut what brings the supreme god himself to Kanstein?\nWhat does he seek here, and where will his path lead?\nBefore the thunder rolls on, let's take a closer look at Zeus!\n \n**Divine Devotions**\nSign in for 7 days for great rewards! Get the Pantheon Grace Visage free on Day 1!\nPure white robes adorned with a golden laurel sash,\nworn beneath the blessing of the gods.\n \n**Thunderous Adventure**\nNew story stages are here! Follow Zeus's journey and uncover what brought him to Kanstein and where fate will take him next.\nClear the story stages to earn 20 Wheel Tickets and get one step closer to having Zeus as your Companion!\n \n**Conquest Echoes**\nPiece together memories of the Thunderous Crusade to reveal stunning illustrations!\nComplete the full collection to earn 27 Wheel Tickets!\n \n**Apotheosis Crucible**\nReady to face Zeus's trials? Show what you're made of!\nTake on the challenge each day for Daily Rewards, build Hype to unlock milestone rewards, and earn rare items like Stellaties and Auroral Badges!\n \n**Thunderous Vault**\nThe vault of the King of the Gods is opening its doors.\nWhat treasures lie within? Head in-game and find out!\n \nThere's plenty up for grabs throughout Thunderous Crusade!\nEarn 62 Wheel Tickets for free, plus all three Visage pieces: Headwear, Facewear, and Outfit, along with rare items including Stellaties, Auroral Badges, and Bond Trinkets!\nAnd there's more! The sacred Zeus Statue is coming to your Home. Equip the Statue Chroma and bask in a touch of Olympian splendor!\nThat's all for the event highlights. Have fun, Adventurers!",
